  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening PK&apos;s response to prevent spread of violent extremism virtually &amp; amongst youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the development cooperation is (i) to increase the capacity and capability of Pakistan&#x2019;s
enforcement bodies to prevent violent extremism (especially online), (ii) to increase interagency
coordination on implementing PVE strategies, and (iii) to ultimately improve the rule of law in Pakistan and
bolster regional stability. To achieve these goals, the project will be implemented under UNODC&#x2019;s Country
Programme III (2022-2025).

The Danish Mission of Islamabad will base the actual support on progress attained in the implementation of
the project as described in the documentation provided by the Grantee or in this jointly agreed document.
Progress will be measured through the UNODC&#x2019;s monitoring framework.</narrative>
  </description>
